= **Three-Act Structure Template**

= A simple template for classical three-act story structure in eight sequences. Write your scenes inside the sections and start drafting!

= Use sections (#) to divide your story into parts. This template also works like a charm with **FTOutliner**, an outlining plugin which you can download from the Plugin Library.

= Also keep in mind that three-act structure is just one way to approach your story. There are no rules and you can do anything — be surprising, silly and brave. Aristotle died over 2200 years ago but you are alive **now.**
# Intro [[purple]]

## 0. Introduction and Framing
= This is the introduction and framing of how Kyle our main hero fucked up
BOSS
GODDAMNIT KYLE! You had one job

KYLE
I'm sorry! What was I supposed to do?

BOSS
If your uncle [James knew he would be so disappointed]

KYLE
Oh yeah bring him up! Just keep bringing him up!

BOSS
It's not much to ask for so that you don't complete your job as an international spy

KYLE
I don't mean to make the department look good I'm sorry!

BOSS
It's fine! You know what I have the debrief, but I want to hear it from you. Why don't you walk me through what happened


# First Act [[blue]]
## Disguise too good
= Establish the central characters, themes and the world we live in. Typically ends with the inciting incident.

KYLE
So there I was in the Polynesian islands

BOSS
Good. We spent a bunch of money getting you there KYLE

KYLE
I was wearing my **Insert description of actor / actress playing spy Maybe audience member!!** disguise. 

BOSS
That's right on track

KYLE
Except it was too good.Nobody suspected me! I tried to make it as suspicious as possible. I was able to walk around freely. Do somersaults freely. Take off my pants freely.

BOSS
Damn it! If it was too good then we don't get more money! Less money equals smaller paychecks! How many times do I have to tell you this KYLE???

KYLE
I'm sorry BOSS!

BOSS
It's fine. 

KYLE
I have brought a lot of shame to this department

BOSS
It's fine! X 7 I don't know how I am supposed to get my kids anything for Christmas this year.

KYLE
You could, I don't know, not have 5 houses in Aspen.

BOSS
Shut. Up. KYLE. That's none of your business.

# Second Beat [[red]]
## Got the femme fatale
= Establish the rules of the new world. The stakes are raised as the main character faces the first real obstacle.

BOSS
So it says in here that you got the femme fatale

KYLE
I didn't mean to be so god damn attractive. It was that damn disguise! I walked in that tavern looking to find our contact so I could get rid the information 

BOSS
Just like we planned

KYLE
Only to find out that I was too late. Like we just missed each other.

BOSS
We do have our no fuck around rule 

^ KYLE ^BOSS
So we don't have to find out!

BOSS
I'm glad your instincts aren't dulled

KYLE
I understood. I didn't care too much. I went to the bar to have a drink. This foxy hot sexy sex momma *wolf noises?* named GERTRUDE STARK walked up to me and offered me a drink

BOSS
Just like we planted her to do. Distract you from your mission!

KYLE
Right! I may have been too much in my feels at the moment and was sad about missing my friend - I mean contact. She ended up consoling me and took me to my room and fell asleep in my lap. It was sweet. I could really have seen a future with her. 


BOSS
They are supposed to get you not you get them! That's how this works! We put her there so you would fail! Failing mean more money KYLE

KYLE
I'm sorry for the way I am BOSS!!

BOSS
It's fine! X 7 I don't know how I am supposed to feed my family for Christmas

KYLE
You know if you sold one of your many ski lodges, maybe the Black Bear Lodge in Aspen Colorado, your family could finally have nice hot meal 

BOSS
No one asked you KYLE!

# Third Beat [[green]]
## Accidentally killed the target

BOSS (CONT'D)
So your biggest fuck up was that you actually killed the target

KYLE
It wasn't my fault I swear!

BOSS
Okay so explain yourself then!

KYLE
Well after GERTRUDE


BOSS
Oh so now we got some sort of super spy!

# Brief Touch of Humanity

## A moment of true vulnerability

KYLE
I don't know what to say other than I'm sorry. I tried BOSS. In the end. I really did. Despite my best efforts to the contrary I still completed the mission. 

# Conclusion

